"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks good to me. Issue exists, and the PR fixes it.\r\nThe issue: `AudioStreamPlaybackPlaylist` ignores `p_rate_scale`, and just calls `mix` on its sub-streams with a hard-coded pitch scale of `1.0`, essentially making the pitch scale property useless.\r\nThe fix: mixing and position updates now account for `p_rate_scale`.\r\n**Disclaimer:** I can't comment much on the mixing step, that's something I'm not super familiar with. But it looks correct to me. The hard-coded values have been replaced, `offset` (records position) is modified by pitch scale, and `stream_todo` is now modified by pitch scale as well, which seems to ensure the playback moves to the next sub-stream at the right time.\r\n\r\nTested:\r\n- Playback position\r\n- Seeking\r\n- Low and high pitch values\r\n- Timing and transitions\r\n- Looping\r\n\r\nDid not test:\r\n- [Global speed scale](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109113) (maybe best handled in a separate PR, and may involve `AudioStreamInteractive` too)\r\n\r\nEverything that I've tested seemed to have worked properly.\r\n\r\nCloses: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104527\r\nIMO, supersedes half of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106550","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115160#pullrequestreview-4663725321","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115160","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115160#pullrequestreview-4663725321"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115160"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-09T14:09:32Z","commit_id":"4772d0a97d75c0527e86feff7e3fba1072261be0"}]